        "title": "The chart below gives information about computer ownership in the US from 1997 to 2012. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant. ",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GqvldeoH7oWjkMxrInvlK8DcgqA\"><em><strong>The chart below gives information about computer ownership per household in the US from 1997 to 2012. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.&nbsp;</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Computer Ownership in US: 1997&ndash;2012</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItVldtCx0op4ggxMZ6HlCEkggZb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><a href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/170/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570?collection=lesson&amp;item=25\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xc6JdDc6OoyCNrxCJmXl5ny0gnh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Computer Ownership in US: 1997&ndash;2012 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ sở hữu m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh tại Mỹ từ 1997 đến 2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKihd8ZOXoPhmzxLDyPlzvG9gYo\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span>&nbsp;trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AENmd32dPoMrGZxIEABlAuMdgLc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q5dfdioskozbouxOnijlpN19g4c\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L6Lld4SqroiQSrxWP7elDN6Mgug\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Computer Ownership in US: 1997&ndash;2012 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ sở hữu m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh - ở Mỹ - 1997-2012.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KnOrdY0TFou8h2xCEZNl06vlgud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><strong><a href=\"https://youpass.vn/course-detail/124/ielts-writing-task-1-aim-6570-internal?collection=lesson&amp;item=26\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</span></a></strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEbNd18N4ojAdxx5thflzyGzgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JjEfdwHlSoUMJqxSNWQltaMEgNg\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hg8DdEKIaoViIsxzmpCljmrugWf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends:</strong> M&aacute;y t&iacute;nh trở n&ecirc;n phổ biến hơn ở Mỹ qua c&aacute;c năm.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hg8DdEKIaoViIsxzmpCljmrugWf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Differences: </strong>Đa số người Mỹ kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave;o năm đầu v&agrave; c&oacute; &iacute;t nhất 1 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave;o năm cuối.<strong>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWd1dsUwQoILZ1xijNxlMAK4gNP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dq7NdiAAVoYsXexMPDglRZR6gle\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:&nbsp;Nh&oacute;m kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; v&agrave; c&oacute; 1 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh</strong>&nbsp;</span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AMS7doEyLoboLgxhLpTl858ggzZ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1997</strong> <em>(70% kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave; 28% c&oacute; 1 m&aacute;y)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YMvPdf44Oo0CYrxdHsjlturQgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của nh&oacute;m c&oacute; 1 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh</strong> <em>(<strong>tăng gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong> l&ecirc;n 50% năm 2003 v&agrave; duy tr&igrave; ở mức n&agrave;y tới năm cuối)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X3TJdXtHyo7NeTxi2YflgGhbgbg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu</strong><strong>&nbsp;hướng</strong> <strong>của nh&oacute;m kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh</strong> <em>(<strong>giảm</strong> xuống c&ograve;n dưới 20% v&agrave;o năm cuối)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtQadl8uuowXXPxlFETljbrFgGh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZtQadl8uuowXXPxlFETljbrFgGh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong> <strong>Nh&oacute;m c&oacute; 2 v&agrave; 3 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh trở l&ecirc;n</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F1m7dPoYgoYvMoxij0Sl4gQGg5b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1997</strong> <em>(5% c&oacute; 2 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave; gần như 0% c&oacute; từ 3 m&aacute;y trở l&ecirc;n)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YhDod6Qqso1kbuxiUmSlDzecgxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng của nh&oacute;m c&oacute; 2 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh</strong> <em>(<strong>tăng dần</strong> l&ecirc;n hơn 20% v&agrave;o năm cuối)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EQ2Hd9S3foL8kKxH6GJlXfi0gEQ\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả xu</strong><strong>&nbsp;hướng</strong> <strong>của nh&oacute;m c&oacute; từ 3 m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh</strong> <em>(<strong>tăng dần</strong> l&ecirc;n gần 10% v&agrave;o năm 2006, sau đ&oacute; &iacute;t thay đổi tới cuối giai đoạn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">Để đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c hơn khi m&ocirc; tả xu hướng tăng/giảm của số liệu, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng những c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">- By contrast,&nbsp;<strong>there was a corresponding drop in</strong> the percentage of Americans without computers...</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">- In the following years, those with just 2 computers <strong>saw a rise in prevalence</strong>, increasing gradually to over a fifth at the end of the period.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">- Likewise,&nbsp;<strong>there was also an upward trend in</strong> the proportion of individuals with three or more computers...</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 249,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UIgTdtbVCoPhmOxgGVrlhgd9gnA\">The line chart compares changes in the percentages of Americans with different numbers of computers in the US from 1997 to 2012.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13676,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 250,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UWSzdu0YRoldRXx8Ef2lqOavgSe\">Overall, computers became more prevalent in Americans over the given period. In addition, at the start of the period, the majority did not own a computer, while by the end of it, most owned at least one computer.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13676,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 251,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CbwOdYpCdoyKBkxOZzzlxtdWgcb\">Looking at the graph in more detail, in 1997, nearly 70% of the US population did not have access to a computer at home, while around 28% had just one. Thereafter, the percentage of Americans with only one computer doubled to around 50% in 2003 before remaining at roughly that level until the end of the period. By contrast, there was a corresponding drop in the percentage of individuals in the US without computers, finishing the period at just under 20%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13676,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 252,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XJ0MdVFo5oBhITx4vOilUIJqgke\">With regard to groups with 2 or more computers, in the beginning, only 5% of US residents owned 2 computers, and almost none had three or more. In the following years, those with just 2 computers saw a rise in prevalence, increasing gradually to over a fifth at the end of the period. Likewise, there was also an upward trend in the proportion of individuals with three or more computers to around 10% in 2006, followed by relatively little change for the rest of the period.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13676,
            "is_toggle_on": true
